.TH drm 1 "@PROJECT_YEAR@" "@PROJECT_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
drm \- manage and benchmark Docker registry mirrors
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B drm
.RI [ OPTION ]...
.IR COMMAND
.RI [ ARGS ]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B drm
stores Docker registry mirror URLs, benchmarks them with ping or HTTP
download tests, and writes the selected mirror to
.BR /etc/docker/daemon.json
as
.BR registry\-mirrors .
.PP
Mirror definitions live under
.RI $XDG_CONFIG_HOME /repoman/drm/ .
On first run,
.B drm
seeds built-in public registry mirrors (Docker Hub and common Chinese
mirrors).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Increase logging verbosity (repeatable).
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Reduce logging verbosity.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print a usage summary and exit successfully.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version information and exit successfully.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
List configured mirrors as
.IR MARK " [" N "] " ALIAS .
See
.BR lrm (1)
for
.B MARK
emoji/ASCII conventions (same markers).
.TP
.BR add " [[" \- PRIORITY "] | " \-p ", " \-\-priority " " N "] " ALIAS URL
Add or update a registry mirror.
.TP
.BR remove " " ALIAS\|NUM
Remove a mirror by alias or list number.
.TP
.BR use " [" \-c ", " \-\-config\-only "] " ALIAS\|NUM
Set
.B registry-mirrors
in
.I /etc/docker/daemon.json
to the chosen URL and reload Docker (unless
.BR \-\-config\-only ).
.TP
.BR pingtest ", " bwtest ", " pingsel ", " bwsel
Same as
.BR lrm (1),
probing the registry
.B /v2/
API endpoint.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/repoman/drm/mirrors
Tab-separated mirror database.
.TP
.I /etc/docker/daemon.json
Docker daemon configuration updated by
.B use " / " pingsel " / " bwsel .
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
List mirrors and apply the fastest:
.B drm list
.br
.B drm bwsel
.SH AUTHOR
Written by @PROJECT_AUTHOR@ <@PROJECT_EMAIL@>.
.SH COPYRIGHT
Copyright \(co @PROJECT_YEAR@.
License AGPL-3.0-or-later.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR lrm (1),
.BR docker (1)
